  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nLogic : **(1st number × 3) - 11 = 2nd number**\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• 37 : 100\n\n​(**37 × 3**__) - 11 = 100\n\n__**111 - 11**__ = 100\n\n100 = 100 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n__\n \n• 29 : 76\n\n​(**29** × 3__) - 11 = 76\n\n__87 - 11__ = 76\n\n76 = 76 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n__\n \n• 24 : ?\n\n​​(24 × 3__) - 11 = ?\n\n__72 - 11__ = ?\n\n**61 = ? **\n\nHence, \"61\" is the correct answer.\n\na3:T97",
